---
import Sponsor from "../sponsor/sponsor.astro";
import SponsorTier from "../sponsor/sponsor-tier.astro";
import OneColumn from "../OneColumn.astro";
---
<section class="text-center space-y-12" id="sponsors">
    <h2>The unconf groups</h2>
    <SponsorTier name="">
        <Sponsor
            name="Ariel OS"
            tier="supporter"
            image="../unconf/arielos.png"
            link="https://ariel-os.org/"
        />
        <Sponsor
            name="Safety-Critical Rust Consortium"
            tier="supporter"
            image="../unconf/safety-critical.png"
            link="https://github.com/Safety-Critical-Rust-Consortium/safety-critical-rust-consortium"
        />
        <Sponsor
            name="Bevy Engine"
            tier="supporter"
            image="../unconf/bevy.svg"
            link="https://bevy.org/"
        />
        <Sponsor
            name="Linebender"
            tier="supporter"
            image="../unconf/linebender.png"
            link="https://linebender.org/"
        />
        <Sponsor
            name="Rust Embedded Working Group"
            tier="supporter"
            image="../unconf/rewg.svg"  
            link="https://rust-embedded.org/"
        />
        <Sponsor
            name="Rust on the GPU"
            tier="supporter"
            image="../unconf/rust-gpu.png"
            link="https://rust-gpu.github.io/"
        />
    </SponsorTier>
</section>
<OneColumn>
    <div class="markdown">
        <p>The unconference hosts these communities:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Bevy Engine</li>
            <li>Linebender</li>
            <li>Rust Embedded Working Group</li>
            <li>Safety-Critical Rust Consortium</li>
            <li>Rust on the GPU</li>
            <li>Ariel OS</li>
        </ul>
    </div>
</OneColumn>
